course: dictionary
lesson: 4673
title: Holey: full of holes
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Holey means full of holes. Look at the sentence around the word to find the clue. «A real mouse would choose peanut butter over a holey wedge of cheese.» A mouse would not want cheese that is full of holes, so holey describes cheese with holes in it.
explain: Use the swap check. Put your meaning into the sentence: «Think of Tom chasing Jerry, a mouse eats a wedge of cheese full of holes.» It still makes sense, so your meaning fits.
explain: Be careful with look-alike words. Holey is not holy, and it is not holiest. «Saudi Arabia contains Mecca and Medina, the two holiest cities of Islam» uses holiest, which is a different word with a different meaning.
fact: Holey means full of holes.
fact: «Holey socks» and «holey jumpers» are clothes with holes worn in them.
fact: In stories, holey can describe something old and worn out.
fact: Holey looks and sounds like holy, but check the spelling: holey has the e.
fact: Holier is the comparing form of holey, but it is rare, so you will hardly ever see it.
exercise: «The old jumper was holey at both elbows.» What does holey mean? | Very heavy | Brand new and shiny | *Full of holes | Hot from the wash
exercise: Jamal says his jeans are holey. What does he mean? | His jeans are very clean | His jeans are sacred | *His jeans have holes worn in them | His jeans are too big
exercise: «A real mouse would rather nibble seeds than a wedge of holey cheese.» Why is the cheese called holey? | It is frozen solid | It is very tiny | *It is full of holes | It is sweet and sticky
test: «The holey tent let the rain in through the top.» What does holey describe? | A tent for two people | *A tent full of holes | A tent that is very tall | A tent that is bright and new
test: Which word means full of holes? | Whole | Holy | *Holey | Holiest
exam: Which sentence uses holey correctly? | Holey means very clever. | The holey sun shone all day long. | *The old sieve was so holey that the pasta fell straight through. | The holey wall was painted sky blue.
